BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_85eccedb-6739-344e-8b8c-0ef1aea8390d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
